  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato and beetroot into small chunks. Slice zucchini into half-moons. Slice brown onion into wedges.\n• Place veggies on lined oven tray. Sprinkle over mild north Indian spice blend, season with salt and drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c584a88ff7790b001fed8/step-1ce55cef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Cut haloumi into 1cm thick slices.\n• In a shallow bowl, place Mumbai spice blend. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip haloumi slices into the spice blend, followed by the egg, and finally in the panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c584a88ff7790b001fed8/step-2e4cd192.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small heatproof bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt and a splash of water and mix to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c584a88ff7790b001fed8/step-0391b170.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c584a88ff7790b001fed8/step-a14e3a5d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To roast veggies, add baby spinach leaves to oven tray with a drizzle of red wine vinegar and olive oil. Gently toss to combine. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c584a88ff7790b001fed8/step-164bff4b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie salad and crumbed Mumbai haloumi strips between plates.\n• Top with garlic yoghurt dressing and flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c584a88ff7790b001fed8/step-af91a63b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
